ren":["不花钱，也不费时间，不去做就行。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["《人体器官捐献和移植条例》第五条：「任何组织或者个人不得以任何形式买卖人体器官，不得从事与买卖人体器官有关的活动」。第十条：「任何组织或者个人不得获取未满 18 周岁公民的活体器官用于移植」。第十一条：「活体器官的接受人限于活体器官捐献人的配偶、直系血亲或者三代以内旁系血亲」。第三十七条规定了买卖人体器官怎么罚。买卖人体器官或者从事与买卖人体器官有关活动的，由县级以上地方人民政府卫生健康部门查处。先没收违法所得，把这笔交易得来的钱全部收走。再按交易额罚 10 倍以上 20 倍以下的钱。医务人员参与的，吊销执业证书并终身禁止从事医疗卫生服务。构成犯罪的，依法追究刑事责任（全国，2024 年 5 月 1 日起施行，原《人体器官移植条例》同时废止）。刑法第二百三十四条之一：「组织他人出卖人体器官的，处五年以下有期徒刑，并处罚金；情节严重的，处五年以上有期徒刑，并处罚金或者没收财产」。还有三种情形，依照刑法第二百三十四条、第二百三十二条定罪处罚。一是未经本人同意摘取他的器官。二是摘取不满十八周岁的人的器官。三是强迫或者欺骗他人捐献器官。这几种按故意伤害、故意杀人处理。案例一：北京市第一中级人民法院 2014 年 8 月 20 日终审的郑伟等 15 人案，涉及 51 枚肾脏，涉案金额 1034 万余元。卖肾的人（供体）「换来的仅仅是 2 万到 2.5 万元不等的报酬」。等肾的病人一方（受体方）出的价码，「以前是一个肾 18 万或 19 万，后来是 21 万或 22 万」。摘肾点是每月 7500 元租的四层小楼，团伙护士长供述该处「脏乱不堪，连抢救设备都没有」。组织者郑伟以组织出卖人体器官罪判处有期徒刑 12 年，其余 14 人判 3 年半至 9 年。案例二：最高人民检察院公布的「少年卖肾买苹果手机」案。17 岁的王某 2011 年 4 月 28 日晚在郴州被切除右肾。动手术的场地，是一家没有移植资质的医院里由人承包的科室提供的。5 月 2 日出院时他拿到 2.2 万元，受体方付给中介的是 15 万元人民币和 1 万美元，主犯获利 5.6 万余元。王某术后肾功能不全，「伤情构成重伤、三级伤残」"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国务院 (2023). 人体器官捐献和移植条例（国务院令第 767 号，第五、十、十一、三十七条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202312/content_6920196.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202312/content_6920196.htm"]},"；全国人大常委会. 中华人民共和国刑法（经刑法修正案十一修正的整合文本）第二百三十四条之一. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808181796a636a0179822a19640c92","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808181796a636a0179822a19640c92"]},"；最高人民检察院 (2012-04-09). 「少年卖肾买苹果手机」案诉至法院. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/gs/201204/t20120409_34342.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/gs/201204/t20120409_34342.shtml"]},"；河北省廊坊市中级人民法院官网转载 (2014-09-02). 全国最大贩肾案终审 组织者摘肾 51 枚获利千万. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://lfzy.hebeicourt.gov.cn/article/detail/2014/09/id/1430881.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://lfzy.hebeicourt.gov.cn/article/detail/2014/09/id/1430881.shtml"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["受益人是你自己。这笔交易表面上是「一次性拿两万」，实际是拿一个器官换一台手机。少年卖肾案的鉴定结论是重伤、三级伤残，休息几个月好不了。那起案子里，检方认定 5 名被告人触犯刑法第二百三十四条第二款，以故意伤害罪起诉。理由之一是医务人员术前没有核实「供体」是不是未成年人，就切了右肾。今天再出同样的事，拉人头的按组织出卖人体器官罪办，摘取不满十八周岁的人的器官，仍然依第二百三十四条按故意伤害罪定罪处罚。黑中介的手术在出租屋或者借来的场地做，没有配型之外的评估，也没有术后随访，出了并发症找不到人认账。真想给亲人捐，走第十一条那条路：在有移植资质的医疗机构做，经伦理委员会审查，全程不收钱。身后的遗体器官捐献是无偿的，不在本条范围。摘掉一个肾之后身体要付什么代价，见第 1 节第 35 条（剩下那个肾替两个干活）。缺钱缺到考虑卖器官的时候，先看第 7 节的救助渠道（失业保险、临时救助、低保）。网贷和「包装材料」贷款的坑，见本节第 6 条。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/09-21"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"别伪造事故、别夸大损失骗理赔：这是保险诈骗罪，帮你作证、帮你修车、帮你鉴定的人一起算"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/09-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"别嫖娼：默认档是拘留 10 到 15 日，不是罚点钱了事"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/09-18"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["对方不满 14 岁就不能发生关系，「她同意」不是理由"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["对方不满 14 岁，不管她同不同意，都按强奸罪从重处理，基本刑期是 3 到 10 年。对方不满 12 岁的，一律认定你「应当知道」。12 到 14 岁的，从发育…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/09-19"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["动手打人前算清这笔账：拘留、赔钱、判刑"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["动手一次的账：拘留 5 到 10 日，加罚 500 到 1000 元。打成轻伤就是刑事案件，判 3 年以下，打成重伤判 3 到 10 年。钱另算：有人打断对方三…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/09-20"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["孩子生下来养不了，只有民政登记这一条合法出路：收钱把孩子给人可能按拐卖罪判，扔下不管是遗弃罪"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["养不了有出路，但合法的只有一条：到民政部门办收养登记，收养关系从登记那天才成立。私下把孩子给人，尤其是收了钱，可能从「送养」变成拐卖儿童罪，起刑就是 5 年以上…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/09-24"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["汉化漫画、搬运影视剧、分享网盘资源和盗版电子书，不收钱也是侵权；挂广告、收会员费就可能判刑"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["别人的作品没经许可翻译了贴出来，或者传到网上，不收钱也是侵权，要删、要赔钱。一挂广告、收会员费，就算为了挣钱。挣到 3 万元、传到 500 部或者会员到 100…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/09-25"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["写同人、做二创拿去出版或卖钱，先取得原作许可，或者把借来的人物名字和关系换成自己的"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["同人哪怕只借了人物名字、性格和关系，拿去出版也可能被判侵权。江南的《此间的少年》借了金庸 60 多个人物，二审判他赔 168 万元，外加 20 万元开支。官司打…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/09-26"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["别为了防身买甩棍、电击器、匕首、辣椒水带在身上，放在车里也算携带"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["匕首、弹簧刀、警棍、电击器这类东西，带出门被查到，可以拘留 5 日以下。带进车站、商场、公交车，拘留 5 到 10 日。真拿出来用也容易吃亏：有人被空手打了一拳…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/09"},"children":["阅读整个主题：普通人容易踩的法律红线 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path",